        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>BIA CARES DONATED 130 NEW BICYCLES AND HELMETS TO NEEDY CHILDREN IN 2024. EACH YEAR BIKES ARE GIVEN TO UNDER PRIVILEDGED CHILDREN ALL OVER SAN DIEGO. 2024'S BIKE DRIVE RECIPIENTS INCLUDED: SWEETWATER ELEMENTARY NAVY SEAL FAMILY FOUNDATIONSTAR/PAL AFTER SCHOOL PROGRAM SD COMMUNITY SOLUTIONS DOMESTIC VIOLENCE PROGRAMNFL RETIRED PLAYERS FOUNDATIONPRO-KIDS GOLF ACADEMY &amp; LEARNING CENTERPROMISES2KIDS FOUNDATIONUSS MONSOOR NAVAL HOLIDAY PROGRAMSTAR/PAL FOUNDATIONMARINE CORPS TOYS FOR TOTSCOPLEY PRICE YMCABARRIO STATION BILATERAL HUMAN TRAFFICKING COALITION FOUNDATIONURBAN STREET ANGELS</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
