        <ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>14248</ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>BIA CARES DONATED $15,000 IN SCHOLARSHIPS TO HIGH SCHOOL AND COLLEGE STUDENTS WHO ARE SEEKING A CAREER IN THE BUILDING INDUSTRY FOR THE 2024 YEAR. STUDENTS MUST BE FULL TIME, FROM SAN DIEGO COUNTY OR GOING TO SCHOOL IN SAN DIEGO AND BE PURSUING A CAREER SUCH AS DEVELOPER, CONTRACTOR, ARCHITECT, CIVIL/STRUCTURAL/SOILS ENGINEER, DESIGNER, BANKER, ACCOUNTANT, LANDSCAPE ARCHITECT, PLANNER, FRAMER, CARPENTER, PLUMBER, ELECTRICIAN OR OTHER REAL ESTATE PROFESSIONS. FOR 2024 WE AWARDED 9 SCHOLARSHIPS, 6 HIGH SCHOOL AND 3 COLLEGE STUDENTS.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
